<title>LAOS: Laos says GDP grows 7.1 pct in fiscal 1996.</title>
<headline>Laos says GDP grows 7.1 pct in fiscal 1996.</headline>
<dateline>VIENTIANE 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Laos will report a 7.1 percent growth in gross domestic product (GDP) and an inflation rate of 12 percent in fiscal 1996, finance minister Saysomphone Phomvihane told Reuters.</p>
</text>
